  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&#x2019;s objective is to sustain and enhance the African Union&#x2019;s ability to promote peace and security, conflict prevention and democratic governance, in order to contribute to AU&#x2019;s ability to take leadership within peace and security in Africa, and formulate holistic and sustainable &#x2018;African solutions to African problems.</narrative>
